{"id":73310,"date":"2026-11-08T20:51:43","date_gmt":"2026-11-08T20:51:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73310"},"modified":"2026-11-08T21:57:01","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T20:57:01","slug":"corrida-sao-silvestre-cidade-falcao-pinhel","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-sao-silvestre-cidade-falcao-pinhel\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o &#8211; Pinhel 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o - Pinhel 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Despede-te do ano a correr na <strong>Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o - Pinhel 2026<\/strong>, agendada para a manh\u00e3 de quinta-feira, <strong>31 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>. Com partidas faseadas a partir das <strong>10:00<\/strong> e meta instalada junto aos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho, no <strong>Largo Ministro Duarte Pacheco<\/strong>, esta prova festiva e 100% gratuita convida atletas federados, populares e fam\u00edlias a fechar o calend\u00e1rio desportivo nas art\u00e9rias da hist\u00f3rica cidade beir\u00e3.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado desenvolve-se em circuito urbano pelas ruas do centro hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Pinhel<\/strong>, sob o olhar das duas torres do emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Castelo de Pinhel<\/strong> e do patrim\u00f3nio amuralhado da <em>Cidade Falc\u00e3o<\/em>, no distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. O programa come\u00e7a \u00e0s 10:00 com a <strong>Corrida da Fam\u00edlia (300 m)<\/strong> e a caminhada pedestre, seguindo-se os escal\u00f5es jovens de <strong>Benjamins B (600 m \u00e0s 10:10)<\/strong>, <strong>Infantis (1,6 km \u00e0s 10:20)<\/strong>, <strong>Iniciados (3,9 km \u00e0s 10:35)<\/strong> e <strong>Juvenis (5 km \u00e0s 10:35)<\/strong>, culminando \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong> com a corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (3 voltas grandes) para Absolutos e Veteranos.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pinhel<\/strong> em parceria com os Servi\u00e7os Sociais, Culturais e Desportivos da autarquia e com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Guarda<\/strong>, a prova distingue-se pelos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos at\u00e9 ao 30\u00ba lugar da geral (350 \u20ac para os vencedores masculino e feminino), pr\u00e9mios para atletas residentes no concelho e pelo tradicional \u00faltimo almo\u00e7o de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o do ano oferecido gratuitamente pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os participantes. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pinhel (Largo Ministro Duarte Pacheco), Pinhel, Guarda<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizin