x 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Pedestre<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o - Pinhel 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de quinta-feira, 31 de dezembro de 2026, nas ruas do centro urbano de Pinhel (distrito da Guarda), com meta junto \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pinhel, no Largo Ministro Duarte Pacheco.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada escal\u00e3o e dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 10:00 com a Corrida da Fam\u00edlia (300 m, nascidos em 2017-2019) e a Caminhada Pedestre. Seguem-se Benjamins B (600 m) \u00e0s 10:10, Infantis (1,6 km) \u00e0s 10:20, Iniciados (3,9 km) e Juvenis (5 km) \u00e0s 10:35, e a corrida principal de 10 km (Absolutos e Veteranos) \u00e0s 11:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual o prazo limite?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 100% gratuita (0,00 \u20ac) para os atletas de todas as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es, devendo ser efetuada online at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 27 de dezembro de 2026. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o oferece ainda o \u00faltimo almo\u00e7o do ano a todos os participantes (acompanhantes t\u00eam um custo de 5,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado e os balne\u00e1rios de apoio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado para levantamento de dorsais estar\u00e1 instalado no Posto de Turismo de Pinhel e funcionar\u00e1 no dia da prova at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:30 (mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de Cart\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3o). Os balne\u00e1rios estar\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na Escola B\u00e1sica do 2\u00ba Ciclo do Agrupamento de Escolas de Pinhel.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva nos 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A prova de 10 km distribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios at\u00e9 ao 30\u00ba lugar da geral masculina e feminina (350 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 300 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba e 250 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba), pr\u00e9mios at\u00e9 ao 5\u00ba lugar nos escal\u00f5es de Veteranos e na Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Coletiva Geral (m\u00ednimo de 8 atletas classificados por clube), al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios especiais de gin\u00e1sio e piscina para atletas naturais ou residentes no concelho de Pinhel. A cerim\u00f3nia decorre \u00e0s 12:30.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o - Pinhel 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-31\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pinhel (Largo Ministro Duarte Pacheco), Pinhel\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Pinhel\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"Corre na Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre Cidade Falc\u00e3o em Pinhel a 31 de dezembro de 2026! Provas gratuitas de 10 km, jovens e caminhada. Inscreve-te at\u00e9 27 de dezembro!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-corrida-sao-silvestre-cidade-falcao-pinhel.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Principal 10 km (Absolutos e Veteranos)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/corrida-sao-silvestre-cidade-falcao-pinhel\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Juvenis (2009-2010)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/corrida-sao-silvestre-cidade-falcao-pinhel\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Iniciados (2011-2012)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\":